  "prefLabel": "Rev 906.03 Form DP-10-ES, Estimated Interest and Dividends Tax",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 906.03 Form DP-10-ES, Estimated Interest and Dividends Tax. Form DP-10 ES, shall be completed and filed by taxpayers subject to the interest and dividends tax to make quarterly payments of the estimated tax due for the current taxable year.\n\nSource. #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5071, eff 2-21-91; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04 (from Rev 906.06); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13433, eff 8-12-22",
